  final class $anon() extends Regex[Tidy[Tuple1[List[Tidy[Tuple2[String, TidyNonEmpty[*:[TidyNonEmpty[Tuple1[List[Tidy[Tuple1[String]]]]], EmptyTuple]]]]]]]] {
